#
# Common tools - the shell commands that are not needed to bring /ext up (flash.dmd keeps those)
#
# Where they go depends on the board: into the firmware (flash.dmd), or - DMBOOT_EXT_TOOLS, set by a board that has an
# external flash - to /ext/bin (ext.dmd, sent by upload-ext), which takes them out of the ROM.
#
ps
reboot
mkdir
cat
catini
memory
service
